      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. but it feels a bit vague. i'm hearing a lot of talk that these mandates are basically just a way to force everyone to go green regardless of whether we can afford it or not. some people say they're just overkill and will crush small businesses. is it actually true that these rules are necessary for the environment, or is it more about just hitting political targets?",
